Package: com.johndie.begonecia
Name: BegoneCIA
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: CC toggle to disable microphone, camera and GPS system-wide. Rootless and RootHide port (iOS 15-27, arm64 and arm64e). Total silence: mic audio is zeroed in the audio server and Siri, location delegates are nulled, camera inputs are dropped.
Depends: mobilesubstrate, com.opa334.ccsupport, ws.hbang.common, preferenceloader, com.opa334.altlist
Conflicts: me.nepeta.begonecia
